{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8lLbH39PW2LVu30EsN_e5Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:06.699524+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8lLbH39PW2LVu30EsN_e5Q","html":"<div><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>为进一步提高研究生生源质量，2027年郑州大学生态与环境学院计划接收推荐免试研究生。现将有关事项通知如下。</span></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、报名条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>凡已取得或预计可取得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的应届本科毕业生均可报名。我院将及时审核报名申请信息，并根据考生填报信息及提交的材料，择优选择符合条件的考生分批次进行复试。</span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二、招生专业</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>学术学位：083000环境科学与工程</span></p><p><span>专业学位：085701环境工程</span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三、提交材料</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.考生亲笔签名的推免预报名申请表；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.身份证正反面及学生证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本科前六个学期成绩单及综合成绩排名证明（加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.外语水平证明（大学英语四、六级考试，托福，雅思，PETS等证书或成绩单）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.有关学术科研成果（发表论文、专利或参与科研项目情况等，论文提供封面及首页，没有可不提供）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.各类获奖、资格证书等体现自身学习和工作能力的材料（没有可不提供）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.以上材料按顺序扫描成一个PDF文件发至邮箱：1958382560@qq.com，时间截止到9月20号上午9点。</span></span></p><p><span><span>预报名QQ群二维码：</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/gBp1VZyu6ETSoCaONNqWH81bwFIN8iaNWMQdULbRibDwhcOCIVfticQyhNaaTwb7oSXq7CdZLyaWibX8Zqoqw7YfJu8Y951zFFyPGZYCsZOouws/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四、复试</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>9月23日前完成复试，具体复试时间及方式另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、学院联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>联系电话：0371-67730288</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span> 统筹：张彤军</span></p><p><span> 终审：冯瑞晓</span></p><p><span> 复审：侯姣  </span></p><p><span> 初审：仲少攀  闫梦莹</span></p><p><span><span> 编辑： 仲少攀    </span></span></p><p><strong><span> 生态与环境学院研究生会宣传部出品</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/gBp1VZyu6ESosesRULnSDDD0oOL0VFuePXr2olcVOcxPESvia12LuWEAxosbjbyAniaaYWEWS1OgbXIibHamhUgnruBLEib6HEpicmAHFnex0ffw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"bcff7f39361b073e66548176ebeee302f6a4aad5ffb000969bb05e5acd33f74c","textLength":552,"sourceSha256":"521e315d5b4a7439726f9fe9a0c8e7f8ca3bd1d4acec078c9bcd7d4dd4c22407","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1a16ae2c2b79715c66d5","title":"2026年郑州大学生态与环境学院2027年接收推免生材料相关工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:06.699524+00:00"}
